{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01VXB2BPp23K69V2SVMsE1FQ", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://parental-control.flashget.com/th/sexual-slang-2025\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.marketingoops.com/campaigns/speak-emoji-to-understand-this-anti-drug-campaign\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.marketingoops.com/?p=78490\"}, {\"url\": \"https://so06.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/KUTH/article/view/284523\"}, {\"url\": \"https://parental-control.flashget.com/th/how-can-parents-understand-teen-slang-without-spying\"}, {\"url\": \"https://files.eric.ed.gov/fulltext/EJ1312742.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://daphnegordon.substack.com/p/from-addies-to-zannies\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.ksat.com/news/local/2020/10/02/the-big-coverup-teens-speaking-in-code\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.ontariocountyny.gov/DocumentCenter/View/177/Is-your-child-a-Tagger\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:57:22.203Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "ป้ายยา ศัพท์วัยรุ่น ความหมาย", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01SWQ8rtQtREKq1knCMaQWmj", "content": [{"title": "FlashGet Kids FlashGet Kids", "url": "https://parental-control.flashget.com/th/sexual-slang-2025"}, {"title": "แคมเปญต่อต้านยาเสพติด ใช้ “Emoji” สื่อสาร หวังเข้าถึงกลุ่มวัยรุ่น", "url": "https://www.marketingoops.com/campaigns/speak-emoji-to-understand-this-anti-drug-campaign"}, {"title": "แคมเปญต่อต้านยาเสพติด ใช้ “Emoji” สื่อสาร หวังเข้าถึงกลุ่มวัยรุ่น", "url": "https://www.marketingoops.com/?p=78490"}, {"title": "ความหมายของคำว่า “วัยรุ่น”: จากภาษากำหนดความคิด สู่ความคิดกำหนดภาษา", "url": "https://so06.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/KUTH/article/view/284523"}, {"title": "FlashGet ส์ FlashGet ส์", "url": "https://parental-control.flashget.com/th/how-can-parents-understand-teen-slang-without-spying"}, {"title": "files.eric.ed.gov", "url": "https://files.eric.ed.gov/fulltext/EJ1312742.pdf"}, {"title": "from addies to zannies", "url": "https://daphnegordon.substack.com/p/from-addies-to-zannies"}, {"title": "the big coverup teens speaking in code", "url": "https://www.ksat.com/news/local/2020/10/02/the-big-coverup-teens-speaking-in-code"}, {"title": "Is your child a Tagger", "url": "https://www.ontariocountyny.gov/DocumentCenter/View/177/Is-your-child-a-Tagger"}]}, "The search didn't return any page that defines \"ป้ายยา\" directly, so I can't confirm its meaning from these results.\n\nWhat the results do cover is related context:\n- Teen slang online is often used to avoid parents and filters, and it spreads through DMs, group chats and game lobbies. These slang terms often come from online subcultures or viral memes.\n- Several results cover drug code words. A US source describes how nicknames and emoji codes are used to create confusion and evade the attention of parents and police.\n- A Thai anti-drug campaign used emoji-based messaging to reach young people, which suggests that drug-related talk in youth culture is a current concern. (marketingoops.com)\n\nFrom my own knowledge, not these results: in Thai online slang, \"ป้ายยา\" usually means promoting or pushing a product, or a person recommending something aggressively. In drug contexts, it can mean luring someone into trying a drug, often with a free sample. Please verify this against a Thai slang dictionary or a more specific search, such as \"ป้ายยา แปลว่า\" or \"ป้ายยา ยาเสพติด.\""], "durationSeconds": 6.170457916, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01VXB2BPp23K69V2SVMsE1FQ", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
