{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgEPt81JjQvagoyfZC4nX", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：「ป้ายยา」**（字面意思是“抹药、涂药”）\n\n在泰语网络用语里，它指卖力地推荐某样东西，让对方被“种草”、想去试一试或买下来。推荐的对象可以是商品、地方或内容。泰文维基词典把它列为口语/俚语，释义是“劝说、诱导（如诱导购买商品）”。中文里对应的说法是“种草”。\n\n搜了 3 次。\n\n依据：\n- [ป้ายยา - วิกิพจนานุกรม](https://th.wiktionary.org/wiki/%E0%B8%9B%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%B2)\n- [ป้ายยา คืออะไร? วิธีพูดขายของแบบ “ป้ายยา” (Lemon8)](https://www.lemon8-app.com/@taladparuay/7604114486714319368?region=th)\n- [วัยรุ่นกับคำว่า ‘ป้ายยา’ หมายถึงอะไร (Lemon8)](https://www.lemon8-app.com/@nookeaw_04/7495244372309541393?region=th)\n- [ป้ายยา ภาษาจีนพูดยังไง? (tutustory)](https://tutustory.com/blog/zhongcao-anli-how-to-say-in-chinese/)\n- [Positioning：แบรนด์จะ 'ป้ายยา' อย่างไร](https://positioningmag.com/insight/85605)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1997, "cache_read_input_tokens": 6998, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1997}, "output_tokens": 5, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:57:45.693Z", "request_id": "req_011CgEPt7gTPtobMbn5wXzYk"}
